## Layer boundaries (do not mix)

| Package | Owns | Must not |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **`iracing/`** | SDK extract / parse | `overlay_mode`, speech, OBS scenes |
| **`obs/`** | thin websocket client | policy / scene choice |
| **`logic/`** | scene state machine + stream chapters | HUD widgets, TTS |
| **`events/`** | candidate events + arbitration input | TTS, OBS, copy catalogs |
| **`overlay/`** | HUD envelope, tape, overlay HTTP/WS | scene switch, `CommentaryDirector` |
| **`commentary/`** | director, sequence graph, TTS | `headlineToken` / overlay i18n |
| **`race/`** | `RaceState` + observer (all overlay modes) | assume Race-session-only |
| **`server/`** | HTTP/WS glue | private `._tape`, `._busy_until`, driving logic |

- **No TUI**: `irswitch_tui` / Textual was removed. Dashboards: `/gr-status`, `/vr-status`. Overlay HUD: `/overlay/`.
- Scene switches: **one** pipeline in `logic/` (explainable `decision_inputs`).
- Overlay and commentary are **peer consumers** of accepted events, not a chain through widget render.

## State machine constraints

- Transitions must be **explicit** and **testable**.
- No hidden side effects inside getters.
- Cooldowns/debounce must be **time-based** (monotonic), not “frame-based”.
